{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787400299254595489,"compiled_state":{"alias":"prissy-comic-koi","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"ae5f32ecb5110a36051b75c5977786d292c23045a850c5cdd31af7e8cce992f2","event_uuid":"049540d6-91b8-4c48-9882-645a8e5da4b8","position":{"commit_sha":"862751e83744b337a5f2daceec40d0e628c2e805","position":"1787397425216542001-049540d6-91b8-4c48-9882-645a8e5da4b8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"1c7c10f6dc7d48394510ec3393236a4f1b020cd9fb4b0c9df3b430b55932abba","event_uuid":"dbf523c9-2359-47d1-a2ac-6d4b16f580d3","position":{"commit_sha":"bf9799bb3fd4e7ffacfde696ffea090dbb329ddf","position":"1787397451150791001-dbf523c9-2359-47d1-a2ac-6d4b16f580d3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787397425216542001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"dbf523c9-2359-47d1-a2ac-6d4b16f580d3","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"2399-5e49-6b28-4d59"}],"description":"## Context\nFiled from the escape analysis on marshy-chummy-coot (2399-5e49-6b28-4d59). The silently-inert primary dedup guard (bug aa7b, origin 789c) left an invariant violation visible in committed production state for the feature's entire life: .bridge_state/bindings.json showed comment_ids == 0 while bindings grew past 2,475 and outbound comment posts kept succeeding. No layer read that signal.\n\n## Proposal (operator to adjudicate; not implemented)\nAdd an in-process, operation-linked invariant check to the reconciler: at end-of-pass summary (or binding-store save), if this pass successfully posted one or more outbound comments AND comment_ids gained no entries, emit a loud signal through the existing bridge_alerts machinery (already part of reduced ticket state, currently surfaced as \"bridge_alerts\": []).\n\nPortability: operation-linked and in-process. It runs wherever the reconciler runs, no CI trigger, satisfying project.portability by construction.\n\nCost: one counter and one comparison per reconcile pass, plus the alert plumbing.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Decide whether the alert fires per-pass or debounced (e.g. only after N consecutive violating passes)\n- [ ] Implement the check behind the existing bridge_alerts surface; alert text names the invariant and the pass\n- [ ] A test drives a pass that posts comments while recording is disabled and asserts the alert fires; a healthy-pass test asserts it does not\n\n## Non-goals\nNo new review criterion, no CI-coupled trigger (ci-gate-compat is rejected precedent), no change to the dedup guard itself (fixed in 8d98c298fa8).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0fa2-fdcb-229e-41a0","ticket_type":"task","title":"Reconciler pass invariant: comment posts succeeded but comment_ids gained none","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["049540d6-91b8-4c48-9882-645a8e5da4b8","dbf523c9-2359-47d1-a2ac-6d4b16f580d3"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787400299254595489,"uuid":"83c32c13-9af1-4d77-a5e7-19ffef90e8db"}